cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these measurements or this software, cite the repository and the commit you used."
title: "Cachino: where coding agents lose prefix reuse"
abstract: >-
  An engine-validated measurement study of vLLM prefix caching under coding-agent
  traffic. Cachino captures agent requests byte for byte, rebuilds exact prompt
  token IDs, predicts each request's prefix-cache hit from a pinned vLLM build's
  rules, attributes recomputed tokens to their causes, and checks every
  prediction against the engine.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: jerkeyray
repository-code: "https://github.com/jerkeyray/cachino"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/jerkeyray/cachino"
date-released: 2026-11-08
keywords:
  - vllm
  - prefix caching
  - kv cache
  - coding agents
  - llm serving
  - measurement
